{"id":"vod_sn_35910","vodId":"35910","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"银狐","name_cn":"银狐","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f8f1b26c2b3d4849a8c36e20f3c83eba.jpg"},"summary":"《银狐》以“冴木神社”为舞台，围绕着主人公冴木真琴（金元寿子 配音）和狐狸神使银太郎（三木真一郎 配音）的奇妙生活展开。　　16岁的冴木真琴看上去是一名普通高中生，实际上她还有另一个身份——冴木神社的第十五代继承人，因此她可以看见一般人肉眼不能看到的狐狸神使银太郎。身为神主的真琴热心助人，却仍不够成熟，加上银太郎外冷内热的性格，他们因此会闹出占卜失误这类事故。不久后神社迎来了新成员神尾悟和神使春，真琴的生活发生着改变……　　本动画改编自落合小夜里创作的同名漫画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gDgpFWKZS01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LBGUECsfwv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6XzWmk5t6E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gcTvuEUpkx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nTqtJSQKfS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HSaDTACXij1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8iZGDxqHTx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ajGJybBBXp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9gS0WqR9mD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WggHsRKdSB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zkKiKmeX7E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K6pH9C5cJj1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.663Z"}